# #1311: the same single-candidate hole on a non-generic operand. `Sharpy.Bytes` declares one
# `operator +` (Bytes, Bytes); before the fix `bytes + int` was accepted on arity alone and
# surfaced as SPY0908 (CS0019 on `Bytes` and `int`).
def main() -> None:
    b: bytes = b"ab"
    a = b + 5
    print(a)
